@startuml

!include docs/uml/theme.puml
left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho
' === External Actors ===
actor "User\n(Worker/Courier/Tourist)" as User
package "External Data Sources" {
  left to right direction
  actor "Map Services" as MapAPI
  actor "Meteo Sources" as Meteo
  actor "Local Open Data" as OpenData
}
actor "Map Services" as MapAPI
actor "Meteo Sources" as Meteo
actor "Local Open Data" as OpenData

' === System Components ===
package "SafeNav System" {

  component "SafeNav UI" as UI
  component "Trip Manager" as TripMgr
  component "Routing Engine" as Router
  component "Comfort Scorer" as Scorer
  component "Environmental Context" as Context

}

' === Actor to Component Interactions ===
User --> UI : defines trip,\nviews results
MapAPI --> Context : tiles, streets
Meteo --> Context : temperature,\ncloud cover
OpenData --> Context : trees,\nbuildings,\nwater

' === Internal Component Relationships ===
UI --> TripMgr : trip input
TripMgr --> Context : request environment
TripMgr --> Router : get routes
TripMgr --> Scorer : score routes

Router --> Context : shade, terrain
Scorer --> Context : heat, water data


note bottom of UI
Handles all user interactions:
• Trip definition (origin/destination)
• Display of route alternatives
• Route selection and guidance
UI may be web or mobile.
end note

note bottom of TripMgr
Core orchestrator for trip planning:
• Validates trip input
• Triggers environmental/context update
• Coordinates routing and scoring
• Prepares results for the UI
end note


@enduml
